TITLE

DEVICE + FIRMWARE FOUNDATION V1


MISSION

Establish the player's local Device as the canonical owner of:

- its mutable display name
- its installed Firmware identity

so that NODE-OS is represented as Firmware installed on a concrete Device
rather than as a universal Synthesis shell constant.

This is a small foundational architecture slice that prepares later NODE-OS
Home work.

Do not redesign NODE-OS in this task.


